{"assessment_is_approval":false,"capture":"bounded quotation and analyst summary of web-reader text; origin HTTP bytes not available","displayed_last_updated":"2017-11-15","id":"wizards-fan-content-current","locator":"rules 1-7; FAQ: What kind of stuff does Fan Content cover?; Can I use all of Wizards IP?; commercial licensing; contact","provider":"Wizards of the Coast","quotation":"Fan Content does not include the verbatim copying and reposting of Wizards’ IP","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14T15:02:02Z","review_summary":"The policy conditionally permits original fan creations shared freely, including websites and personal enjoyment. It requires unofficial attribution, existing notices, respect for third-party rights and compliance with Wizards terms, and excludes verbatim copying/reposting and specified mechanics/logos/trademarks. Donations, advertising and sponsorship may support qualifying free content subject to conditions; paid access, sales and compensated licensing need additional permission. It is not blanket authorization for this verbatim source-derived database or an unspecified future service.","source_url":"https://company.wizards.com/en/legal/fancontentpolicy","upstream_capture":{"bytes":null,"capture":"origin HTTP bytes not exposed by web reader","rendered_tool_text_bytes":13154,"rendered_tool_text_sha256":"591bf3a33cd64e2041e666258d6f41631d24bb0c5e9d2d6213711ce8ecc66d98","retrieval_started_at":"2026-10-14T15:02:02Z","sha256":null,"upstream_git_retained":false}}
